2. Permitted academic use
You may access, run, copy, study and modify the covered material without a fee
solely for non-commercial academic research, scholarly evaluation, reproducibility
studies and teaching. You may publish your scientific findings, including in
journals that charge publication or subscription fees. Those publication fees
alone do not make an otherwise permitted academic study commercial.

3. Commercial use is not granted
This licence does not permit selling or licensing the covered material, providing
