Use on behalf of a commercial client, or for commercial operational routing, is
not permitted. Any such use requires a separate written licence from the relevant
rights holders before the use begins. No commercial permission is implied by
public availability, academic affiliation or an absence of revenue at the time.

4. Sharing and modifications
You may share the covered material and your modifications for the purposes in
section 2, provided that you include this licence, retain existing copyright and
third-party notices, identify substantive modifications and preserve these use
